{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JY2Rm99quoiAL5X6SKee6U","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# tricoach\n2\t\n3\tBackend + single-page app for a small triathlon coaching practice. Coaches\n4\tplan the week; athletes see it and connect their Intervals.icu account so the\n5\tapp can read wellness data and push planned workouts to their calendar. The\n6\tathlete signs in to tricoach (token in `localStorage`, sent as\n7\t`Authorization: Bearer` by the SPA's fetch wrapper), then clicks\n8\t\"Connect Intervals.icu\", which runs the OAuth flow against Intervals.\n9\t\n10\t`server.py` is stdlib only (`python3 server.py`, port 8766) and keeps\n11\teverything in memory; the shape is the same as the Postgres tables in prod.\n12\tDev sign-in tokens: `tok-okafor` (default in the SPA) and `tok-rivera`.\n13\t`config.py` holds the OAuth client placeholders. `logs/` has what we captured\n14\twhile looking into the connection problems.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1fb927fd-060b-4dca-ba58-87421c200a5e","uuid":"93da2831-61de-4cbc-a0de-15c1d0021011","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:18:51.434Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-59qfZt/README.md","content":"# tricoach\n\nBackend + single-page app for a small triathlon coaching practice. Coaches\nplan the week; athletes see it and connect their Intervals.icu account so the\napp can read wellness data and push planned workouts to their calendar. The\nathlete signs in to tricoach (token in `localStorage`, sent as\n`Authorization: Bearer` by the SPA's fetch wrapper), then clicks\n\"Connect Intervals.icu\", which runs the OAuth flow against Intervals.\n\n`server.py` is stdlib only (`python3 server.py`, port 8766) and keeps\neverything in memory; the shape is the same as the Postgres tables in prod.\nDev sign-in tokens: `tok-okafor` (default in the SPA) and `tok-rivera`.\n`config.py` holds the OAuth client placeholders. `logs/` has what we captured\nwhile looking into the connection problems.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JY2Rm99quoiAL5X6SKee6U","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
